{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Plip - one silver ripple starts to grow.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Reef to shore, follow where the blue waves go.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A is Angelfish, fins open wide | turning gently with the tide.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B is Buoy, bobbing on blue | anchored while boats pass through.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C is Coral, animals side by side | building reefs where fish hide.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D is Dock, by the shore | boats tie up once more.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "E ... Eel! Long fish, no feet | bending through a rocky retreat.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F is Fish, fins steer | gills take oxygen from water near.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G ... Grouper! Waits by a ledge | broad mouth hiding near the edge.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H is Harbor, sheltered from spray | calmer water where boats can stay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash, come ride with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Splash through letters, A to Z.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-3",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Say the word, then feel the flow,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-4",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Wave by wave, away we go.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I? Island! Land ringed blue | water on every side, every view.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "J is Jetty, built from shore | guarding coasts or guiding channels.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Kayak - that's K, paddle in hand | left then right, turn as planned.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L ... Lobster! Walks the seafloor | long antennae feel what's before.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M is Mussel, shell halves lock | silky threads hold tight to rock.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N? Narwhal! Through Arctic blue | spiral tusk, one long tooth - true!",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "O is Octopus, eight arms wide | soft body squeezes through to hide.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P is Pelican, bill dips low | pouch catches fish, lets water flow.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash, come ride with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Splash through letters, A to Z.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-3",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Say the word, then feel the flow,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-4",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Wave by wave, away we go.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Quahog! Say KOH-hog | hard clam buried in sand or mud.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R is Ray, fins spread wide | gliding low where shadows slide.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S? Seahorse! Small and slow | curled tail grips seagrass in the flow.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "T is Turtle, at sea flippers sweep | steady through water deep.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "U ... Undersea Cave, dark below | seawater enters where sunlight can't go.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V is Violet Sea Snail, afloat | hangs beneath its bubble raft.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W is Whale, up for air | big breath, down from there.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X? X-ray Tetra, freshwater not sea | translucent sides, some bones we see.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Y is Yellowfin Tuna, finlets flash | streamlined body makes an ocean dash.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z ... Zooplankton! Ride the flow | tiny drifters where the currents go.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash, come ride with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Splash through letters, A to Z.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-3",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Say the word, then feel the flow,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-4",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Wave by wave, away we go.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "My turn: I call the letter. You bring the word back.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "A ... Angelfish! Fan both hands and glide.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "B ... Buoy! Bob one hand with the tide.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C ... Coral! Spread fingers side by side.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "D ... Dock! Make a platform by your side.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "E ... Eel! Wave one hand side to side.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "F ... Fish! Swish one hand and glide.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G ... Grouper! Hide low by a ledge.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "H ... Harbor! Curve both hands into a bay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash, come ride with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Splash through letters, A to Z.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-3",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Say the word, then feel the flow,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-4",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Wave by wave, away we go.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "I ... Island! Circle one hand all around.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "J ... Jetty! Reach outward from solid ground.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "K ... Kayak! Paddle left, then right.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "L ... Lobster! Walk two fingers on the floor.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "M ... Mussel! Close two palms like a shell.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "N ... Narwhal! Trace one spiral tusk.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "O ... Octopus! Wiggle both hands, soft and slow.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "P ... Pelican! Scoop, then let the water go.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash, come ride with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Splash through letters, A to Z.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-3",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Say the word, then feel the flow,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-4",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Wave by wave, away we go.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Quahog! KOH-hog - close your clam.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "R ... Ray! Glide both hands above the sand.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "S ... Seahorse! Curl one finger in the flow.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "T ... Turtle! Sweep both hands as you go.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "U ... Undersea Cave! Arch both hands below.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "V ... Violet Sea Snail! Bubble-raft, float slow.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "W ... Whale! Rise for air, then dive.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "X ... X-ray Tetra! Freshwater fish - glide.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Y ... Yellowfin Tuna! Sweep fast through the flow.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Z ... Zooplankton! Drift where currents go.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash, come ride with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Splash through letters, A to Z.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-3",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Say the word, then feel the flow,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-4",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Wave by wave, away we go.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "One last ripple reaches shore.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "A to Z, then one wave more.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
